---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Wenatchee Well Pros | Well Pump Experts in North Central WA"
  description="Meet Wenatchee Well Pros, a local crew fixing well pumps and pressure tanks across Chelan, Douglas, and Grant counties. Fast response, honest written estimates."
  canonical="https://wenatcheewellpros.com/about/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://wenatcheewellpros.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://wenatcheewellpros.com/about/"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What areas do you serve?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We cover North Central Washington, including Wenatchee, East Wenatchee, Cashmere, Leavenworth, Lake Chelan, Quincy, and Moses Lake. That's most of Chelan, Douglas, and Grant counties. If you're on a private well in that area, give us a call at (509) 351-8404."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you charge for estimates?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Estimates are free, and you get them in writing before any work starts. If you want a ballpark first, our well pump cost guide at /well-pump-cost/ breaks down typical repair and replacement prices."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are you available for emergencies?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, 24/7. If your water stops at 2 a.m. or on a holiday weekend, call us. Most no-water calls in our service area get a tech the same day."}}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #333A3F; }
  .rich a { color: #B96A2C; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<!-- HERO -->
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #08344B 0%, #0E4D6E 65%, #08344B 100%);padding:72px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#8FD0EA;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-weight:700;color:#F6F3ED;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">A Local Crew That Hates Seeing You Without Water</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(246,243,237,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We're well pump techs from right here in the Wenatchee Valley. We show up fast, explain things in plain English, and put every estimate in writing before we touch a thing.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-cream">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:+15093518404" class="btn-outline-white">Call (509) 351-8404</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="A Local Crew That Hates Seeing You Without Water" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>

<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="rich"><p>Wenatchee Well Pros started the way a lot of good local businesses do, out of frustration. Our founders spent years working on wells across North Central Washington and kept seeing the same thing. A family loses water on a Friday, calls around, and gets told someone might make it out Tuesday. Days without water, in a region where summer hits triple digits and winter freezes pipes solid. That didn't sit right with us, so we built a company around fixing it.</p><p>Today we serve homeowners and orchardists from <a href="/well-service-leavenworth/">Leavenworth</a> and <a href="/well-service-cashmere/">Cashmere</a> down the valley through Wenatchee and <a href="/well-service-east-wenatchee/">East Wenatchee</a>, up to <a href="/well-service-chelan/">Lake Chelan</a>, and out across the Columbia Basin to <a href="/well-service-quincy/">Quincy</a> and <a href="/well-service-moses-lake/">Moses Lake</a>. We know this country. Deep basalt wells, long pump sets, hard water, irrigation systems that can't afford downtime during the growing season.</p><p>Most of our work is <a href="/well-pump-repair-wenatchee/">well pump repair</a>, <a href="/well-pump-replacement-wenatchee/">pump replacement</a>, and <a href="/pressure-tank-replacement-wenatchee/">pressure tank service</a>, plus <a href="/emergency-well-service-wenatchee/">24/7 emergency calls</a> when the water just stops. We're licensed and insured in Washington, and estimates are always free.</p><p>Here's the simple version of how we operate. We answer the phone. We tell you what's wrong in words that make sense. We hand you a written price before we start. And we never sell you a new pump when a $40 part will fix the one you've got.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="section-tag">How We Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What You Can Expect</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 8px;">Show Up Fast</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">No water is an emergency, not an inconvenience. We run 24/7 emergency service because a house without water can't wait until Tuesday.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 8px;">Plain English, Always</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You'll know exactly what failed, why it failed, and what your options are. No jargon, no scare tactics, no mystery line items.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 8px;">Written Estimates Before Work</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You get a clear price in writing before we pick up a wrench. If something changes once we're in the well, we stop and talk to you first.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 8px;">No Upsells</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">If a repair will do the job, we repair it. We'll only recommend a replacement when the math actually favors it, and we'll show you that math.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#F6F3ED;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="section-tag">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 10px;">What areas do you serve?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">We cover North Central Washington, including Wenatchee, East Wenatchee, Cashmere, Leavenworth, Lake Chelan, Quincy, and Moses Lake. That's most of Chelan, Douglas, and Grant counties. If you're on a private well in that area, give us a call at (509) 351-8404.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 10px;">Do you charge for estimates?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">No. Estimates are free, and you get them in writing before any work starts. If you want a ballpark first, our well pump cost guide at /well-pump-cost/ breaks down typical repair and replacement prices.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4D6E;margin:0 0 10px;">Are you available for emergencies?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Yes, 24/7. If your water stops at 2 a.m. or on a holiday weekend, call us. Most no-water calls in our service area get a tech the same day.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BANNER -->
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0E4D6E 0%, #16648C 50%, #0E4D6E 100%);padding:64px 24px;text-align:center;">
  <h2 style="font-family:'Zilla Slab',Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,40px);font-weight:700;color:#F6F3ED;margin-bottom:16px;">Need a Well Pump Pro in North Central Washington?</h2>
  <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(246,243,237,0.8);margin-bottom:28px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Free written estimates. Emergency no-water calls answered around the clock.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a href="/#contact" class="btn-cream">Get Free Estimate</a>
    <a href="tel:+15093518404" class="btn-outline-white">Call (509) 351-8404</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
